  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Digital technology skills to enhance employability in Iraq</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project aims promoting employability among young refugees, IDPs, returnees and their host communities focusing on women and contributing to economic development and shared prosperity while Improving awareness, knowledge and skills in entrepreneurship and digital technologies for wage-employment and self-employment among youth through capacity building of training institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
